# js/fset: the /fset defaults. Every line here is an `fset NAME value` line,
# the same lines a jsrc carries and /save writes. A theme (js/themes/<THEME>)
# sits over these; the operator's own fset lines sit over the theme.
#
# A message's format defaults to its js/messages.py text; the ones below
# differ from it.

